@startuml
title Astral Project — Components and Implementation Status
left to right direction
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

legend right
  |= Color |= Status |
  |<#DDF2DD> | Implemented |
  |<#FFF2CC> | Partial or integration pending |
  |<#E7E7E7> | Target architecture; not implemented |
endlegend

actor "Trusted human" as Human

package "Local trusted boundary" {
  component "aspr CLI\nversion + host probe" as CLI #DDF2DD
  component "asprd\nstatus/liveness daemon" as Daemon #FFF2CC
  database "SQLite state\nand audit schema" as State #FFF2CC
  component "rclone" as Rclone #E7E7E7
  component "aspr-transport" as Transport #E7E7E7
  component "aspr-homed\nFUSE policy filesystem" as Homed #E7E7E7
  component "Local bubblewrap\npolicy compiler/launcher" as LocalBwrap #E7E7E7
  collections "Signing key +\nSSH transport key" as Keys #FFF2CC
}

package "Local untrusted boundary — target" #E7E7E7 {
  component "Agent harness\nand descendants" as Agent
  component "Sandbox aspr client" as SandboxCLI
  interface "Narrow session API" as SessionAPI
  folder "Projected HOME" as ProjectedHome
  folder "Pre-mounted remote views" as RemoteViews
}

cloud "OpenSSH authenticated channel" as SSH #FFF2CC

package "Remote enrolled-user boundary" {
  component "aspr-server\nforced-command entry" as Server #DDF2DD
  component "Broker bridge\nsocketpair + SCM_RIGHTS" as Bridge #DDF2DD
}

package "Remote privileged boundary" {
  component "systemd socket" as Systemd #DDF2DD
  component "Root broker\nSO_PEERCRED + grant/ceiling validation" as Broker #DDF2DD
  component "Safe resolver +\ndescriptor pinning" as Resolver #DDF2DD
  component "Execution-plan builder\nsealed memfd + fixed FD ABI" as Plan #DDF2DD
  component "Native mount worker\nuser/mount namespaces" as Worker #DDF2DD
  database "Issuer keys + per-root\nserver ceiling" as Ceiling #DDF2DD
  folder "Content-addressed\nSFTP runtime closure" as Runtime #DDF2DD
  component "Expiry and worker\nreaping registry" as Registry #DDF2DD
}

package "Remote confined workload" {
  folder "Synthetic root +\ndescriptor-pinned exports" as Synthetic #DDF2DD
  component "AppArmor-confined\nsftp-server" as SFTP #DDF2DD
  folder "Explicitly granted\nremote objects" as Granted #DDF2DD
}

Human --> CLI
CLI ..> Daemon : future control surface
Daemon --> State
Daemon ..> Keys
Daemon ..> Rclone : future supervision
Rclone ..> Transport : future external SSH
Daemon ..> SSH : target session control
SSH --> Server : aspr-channel-v1
Server --> Bridge : authenticated request
Bridge --> Systemd : CreateNamespaceV1 +\npassed stream FD
Systemd --> Broker
Broker --> Ceiling : revalidate authority
Broker --> Resolver : open under configured roots
Resolver --> Plan : pinned source FDs
Plan --> Worker : sealed plan + fixed FDs
Runtime --> Worker : verified runtime FD
Worker --> Synthetic : open_tree, mount_setattr,\nmove_mount, pivot_root
Worker --> SFTP : drop authority; fixed exec\nwith AppArmor transition
SFTP --> Granted : kernel-enforced RO/RW access
Broker --> Registry : retain termination authority

Daemon ..> Homed : future supervision
Homed ..> ProjectedHome
Daemon ..> LocalBwrap : future policy launch
LocalBwrap ..> Agent
Agent ..> ProjectedHome
Agent ..> RemoteViews
SandboxCLI ..> SessionAPI
SessionAPI ..> Daemon

note bottom of Agent
Future local sandbox contract: no SSH keys, /dev/fuse,
raw rclone configuration, privileged sockets,
generic mount authority, or profile-approval power.
end note
@enduml
